"Some monsters are reborn souls from another world, called Experiments by the gods."
"The known Experiments are Syl the slime, Vee the spider, Leon the crab, a dragon and a blood troll."
"Syl is a shapeshifting Chimeric Cluster Slime of tier five who can pose as any people."
"Vee is a tier-five giant spider and Syl's bonded companion; she can teleport at will."
"Reborn souls may only be reborn as humans, elves or dwarves, unless a god makes an Experiment."
"Siren spies with the Infiltrator mutation have lived for years among humans with classes."
"Mermen sirens can take each other's places in disguise, and Identify shows their false faces."
"Becoming a dungeon master cures a monster's evolution madness as a kind of signing bonus."
"The Spider Queen Qhilleeqeth became a dungeon master to regain her sanity, and serves Mother."
"The gods sometimes stir up world events, such as a demon king's invasion, out of boredom."
"Black slimes are forbidden from leaving the demon labyrinth, where they clean up corruption."
"The only ocean slime is a jellyfish that evolved into a slime."
"A dragon Experiment has already destroyed a dungeon and has not been heard of since."
